  with score, mistakes and correct answers; retake allowed; 80% unlocks next.
- Remove the one-question /quiz/check endpoint and the KBC panel.
- Add scripts/quizzes.part9.json and unit + integration tests.
- .gitignore: storage/ -> /storage/ (it also hid src/lib/storage).

